          </item>
          <item row="4" column="0" colspan="3">
           <widget class="QCheckBox" name="checkBox_ctdb_repair">
            <property name="toolTip">
             <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;If the CUETools database (CTDB) reports differences after the rip, Audex downloads its recovery data and repairs the image. The image is only replaced if it matches the database afterwards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enables the CTDB verification for image rips. Without differences nothing is downloaded or changed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>Repair with the CUETools database if differences are found</string>
